### 演示 HTTP 工具 — 通过 API 注册（需先登录拿 Token）
### 若已执行 SQL 种子 V1.9.0，可跳过本文件的 create，直接测 invoke

@base = http://127.0.0.1:8081
@token = {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### 1. 登录
# @name login
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Mhqf@123456"
}

### 2. 注册回声工具
POST {{base}}/api/v1/tools/create
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "回声工具",
  "description": "将用户输入的文本原样返回，用于验证对话内工具调用链路。",
  "toolType": "HTTP",
  "endpoint": "http://127.0.0.1:8081/api/v1/demo-tools/echo",
  "inputSchema": "{\"method\":\"POST\",\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"message\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"要回显的文本\"}},\"required\":[\"message\"]}",
  "outputSchema": "{\"type\":\"object\"}",
  "requireApproval": false
}

### 3. 注册当前时间
POST {{base}}/api/v1/tools/create
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "当前时间",
  "description": "按指定时区返回当前日期时间与星期，默认 Asia/Shanghai。",
  "toolType": "HTTP",
  "endpoint": "http://127.0.0.1:8081/api/v1/demo-tools/current-time",
  "inputSchema": "{\"method\":\"POST\",\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"timezone\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"IANA 时区\"}},\"required\":[]}",
  "outputSchema": "{\"type\":\"object\"}",
  "requireApproval": false
}

### 4. 注册城市天气（模拟）
POST {{base}}/api/v1/tools/create
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "城市天气查询",
  "description": "查询指定城市的模拟天气。用户问某地天气时可调用。",
  "toolType": "HTTP",
  "endpoint": "http://127.0.0.1:8081/api/v1/demo-tools/city-weather",
  "inputSchema": "{\"method\":\"POST\",\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"city\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"城市名称\"}},\"required\":[\"city\"]}",
  "outputSchema": "{\"type\":\"object\"}",
  "requireApproval": false
}

### 5. 注册简易计算器
POST {{base}}/api/v1/tools/create
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "简易计算器",
  "description": "执行加减乘除。op=add/sub/mul/div，参数 a、b。",
  "toolType": "HTTP",
  "endpoint": "http://127.0.0.1:8081/api/v1/demo-tools/calculator",
  "inputSchema": "{\"method\":\"POST\",\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"op\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"a\":{\"type\":\"number\"},\"b\":{\"type\":\"number\"}},\"required\":[\"op\",\"a\",\"b\"]}",
  "outputSchema": "{\"type\":\"object\"}",
  "requireApproval": false
}

### 6. 直连探测（无需登录，白名单）
POST {{base}}/api/v1/demo-tools/echo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "hello tool"
}

###
POST {{base}}/api/v1/demo-tools/current-time
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "timezone": "Asia/Shanghai"
}

###
POST {{base}}/api/v1/demo-tools/city-weather
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "city": "上海"
}

###
POST {{base}}/api/v1/demo-tools/calculator
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "op": "mul",
  "a": 12,
  "b": 3.5
}
